  howard says represents the biggest  overhaul ever  what is everwild we don't really know  and that could be because despite an  early trailer showing a whimsical forest  filled with magic developer rare has  reportedly had trouble nailing down the  core design elements early on at the  time of its announcement it was  primarily a third person adventure game  with with god game elements and it  appears rare doesn't want to rush into  showing off more until it nails down  exactly how to move forward on the  project  the fable series has been on ice for a  couple years with a multiplayer spin-off  getting cancelled after its beta period  last generation and the panned fabled  the journey releasing for connect on  xbox 360 before that however the newest  game which is apparently a reboot touted  as a new beginning for the series is  developed by the open world masters at  playground games thus far the studio's  output has been limited to the forza  horizon games so it remains to be seen  how it will handle a fantasy rpg  the other half of the forza franchise  forza motorsport appears to be getting a  reboot of sorts with the simply titled  well forza motorsport developed by long  time forza studio turn 10 the game will  only be available on xbox series x and s  and pc meaning it should be able to  better leverage the newer hardware the  game doesn't yet have a release window  or many gameplay details but an  in-engine teaser trailer is so  stunningly realistic that's difficult to  tell it's actually a video game and not  real life  thanks to lucasfilm expanding its  licensing deals we're getting more games  based on the company's iconic franchises  and one of these is a new indiana jones  games from the makers of the new  wolfenstein games very little is known  about the indiana jones game but  bethesda veteran todd howard an indiana  jones superfan is producing it in fact  he's been trying to get it off the  ground for a decade already so it's been  a long time in the works given that  machine games is now owned by xbox you  can expect the title to be exclusive to  xbox and pc but this hasn't been  confirmed  created by new studio the initiative and  billed as a quadruple a game whatever  that means perfect dark is an espionage  game that follows in the footsteps of  rare's original adventures starring  joanna dark a short teaser trailer  focused on the role corporations had in  the continued dystopian unraveling of  mankind is all we've seen thus far of  the game though it does confirm that  joanna herself will be featured in the  game the initiative aims to quote  reimagine the franchise for a new  generation though it remains to be seen  exactly how that will play out the  original nintendo 64 game took heavy  inspiration from rare's previous title  goldeneye 007  the next game from arcane studios  creators of the dishonored series and  death loop looks to be quite a departure  the cooperative first person shooter  coming summer 2022 to xbox series xs and  pc tasks you and your friends with  destroying the vampire plague that has  overrun the town it allows for  single-player gameplay as well and  arcane promises that it retains the  studio's signature level design to help  it stand out from other competitive  shooters with character customization  and special abilities alongside vampires  human enemies dedicated to worshiping  the vampires will also stand in your way  and hopefully your bullets weigh  the first hellblade was a flawed but  refreshingly unique take on the hack and  slasher genre combining it with a  psychological horror tale focused on the  mental health of senua as she attempts  to save her dead lover's soul now with  the backing of microsoft formerly  independent studio ninja theory is  revisiting senua with senua saga  hellblade 2. sending her to iceland for  reasons currently unclear  the next role-playing game from the  legendary bethesda studios and the first  not involving elder scrolls or fallout  starfield is aiming for something  remarkably different from either series  its approach to science fiction role  playing will be grounded in reality  fitting into the hard sci-fi subgenre  associated with films like the arrival  and the martian given the emphasis  science fiction games tend to put on  realizing the impossible this should  certainly make starfield stand out and  you can still expect immense scale and  plenty of exploration opportunities when  it hits xbox series x and s and pc in  november of 2022  zombie games are so common nowadays that  you can barely go a week without a new  one releasing but undead labs state of  decay games are unique in how they blend  direct third person action with base and  resource management the result is a  story all your own and one that often  leads to unexpected outcomes with the  studio now part of microsoft it will  hopefully receive an even larger budget  in order to polish state of decay 3 when  it eventually releases  obsidian entertainment is best known for  making sequels to already established ip  like fallout and star wars knights of  the old republic but in recent years it  has been able to flex his creative  muscles with more original creations the  outer worlds was a short but sweet first  person rpg that makes biting political  satire with great characters and  character progression that allowed you  to permanently hamstring your own  abilities in order to increase them in  another area the outer worlds 2 now made  with the company as an internal  microsoft studio looks to improve on the  original hopefully making it a bit  longer in the process  tunic or the cute fox game as we like to  call it is a classic exploration action  adventure in the vein of zelda and the  developers specifically took inspiration  from the original game because of its  lack of direction or clear objectives  given to the player this is what  encourages true exploration and  discovery which is at the heart of any  good adventure game and the puzzles will  also not be so video gaming so as to  break the immersion tunic will be  available on xbox one xbox series xns  and pc on march 16th 2022  from the developers of warhammer  vermintide darktide is a four-player  co-op action game that introduces a  deeper gunplay system to the warhammer  games dark tide takes place in the hive  city of tertium and you play a convict  turn agent who's aiding in a mission to  exterminate chaos cultist corruption the  game is currently scheduled to release  in spring of 2022. what's your most  anticipated xbox exclusive of 2022 let  us know in the comments below  you
 

